			<br><br>

			<<link [[안심시킨다|Dilapidated Gawker Reassure]]>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<npcincr Sydney purity 2>><</link>><<glove "Sydney">><<gspurity>>
			<br>
			<<link [[무시한다|Dilapidated Gawker Ignore]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놀린다|Dilapidated Gawker Tease]]>><<npcincr Sydney purity -2>><</link>><<exhibitionist1>><<lspurity>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
