	<<case "special">>
		"Oh, definitely," you say. "You do realise we have probably become the most interesting rumour in town?"
		<br><br>
		Sydney exhales through <<his>> nose, halfway between embarrassment and pride. "That may help, yes."
	<<default>>
		"그런 것 같아요." 당신이 말한다.
		<br><br>
		시드니가 고개를 끄덕인다. "그랬으면 좋겠네요."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Dilapidated End]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Dilapidated Gag Refuse
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"I-I don't want people seeing me lead you around on a leash," you say. "They might get the wrong idea."
	<<case "docile">>
		"That feels like a little too much," you admit. "At least for in front of strangers."
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"That may be pushing things," you say. "I would rather not become the main attraction before the shop even opens."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"No thanks," you say. "People would just think we're weird, and I am saving that for later."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Absolutely not," you say. "I am not parading you around for free."
	<<case "special">>
		"Tempting," you say, "but perhaps we should not give the public all our best material at once."
	<<default>>
		"그건 좀 과한 것 같아요." 당신이 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
Sydney lets out a small sigh of relief, as though part of <<him>> had expected you to say yes. "You're right," <<he>> says. "Come on. There's still plenty to sort through."
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Dilapidated End]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Dilapidated Paint Suit Romance
<<effects>>
<<clothesstrip>>
당신은 앞치마를 벗고, 자신의 옷을 벗기 시작한다. 시드니는 당신을 쳐다보고, 아닌 척하지도 않는다. 당신도 똑같이 해준다.
<<exhibitionism2>>
앞치마만 걸치니 훨씬 편안하다. "이런." 시드니가 말한다. 당신이 쳐다보니, <<his>> 어깨끈 하나가 풀려
<<if $pronoun is "m">>
	<<his>> 가슴 일부가 드러나 있다.
<<else>>
