:: Dilapidated Paint Watch 2
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"I-I'd rather watch," you say. "Sorry."
	<<case "docile">>
		"I think I prefer this angle," you admit quietly.
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"No, keep going," you say. "The view suits me perfectly well from here."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"Nah," you say. "I want to watch you struggle."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Keep going," you say. "You look more interesting when you are trying not to be self-conscious."
	<<case "special">>
		"Why would I interrupt this?" you ask. "It has become unexpectedly educational."
	<<default>>
		"이 광경이 딱 좋네요." 당신이 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
"That so?" Sydney asks. <<He>> turns around and bends over as <<he>> shuffles the apron higher, making a performance of pretending not to show off while very clearly doing exactly that. When <<he>> faces you again, <<he>> draws the straps over <<his>> shoulders and leaves you with a lingering look that dares you to keep staring.
<br><br>
<<He>> seems markedly more comfortable painting without <<his>> clothes, loose and almost smug in the apron alone, but <<he>> still dresses again before Sirris returns to the main room.
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Dilapidated End]]>><</link>>
<br>

