:: Dilapidated Dildo Tease
<<effects>><<wearProp "dildo">><<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"...There's nothing to be ashamed of," you say, lifting the dildo from the crate. "See? Or does the temple consider it profane?"
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"Surely the temple has encountered something more scandalous than this," you say, turning it lightly in your hand.
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"What's the matter?" you ask, lifting out the dildo. "It's not a snake. Does the temple forbid anything this profane?"
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Look at you," you say. "Flustered by carved rubber. How devout."
	<<default>>
		"It's nothing to be afraid of," you say, lifting out the dildo. "It's just an inert object. Or does the temple consider it profane?"
<</switch>>
<br><br>
You give it a small, thoughtless wave for emphasis, which only makes Sydney blush harder.
<br><br>
"I-it's not that," Sydney says, looking firmly anywhere but at either you or the dildo. "Just put it back in the crate. We have lots to do."
<br><br>
